WEBVTT

00:00:02.090 --> 00:00:04.710
You did well to finish in such
 a short amount of time.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:11.440
The Infinity Theater will become
 Tokyo's new symbol of hope.

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:14.900
Having Kark Kaburagi perform at the
construction commemoration concert

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:15.870
is rather extravagant.

00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:20.650
Our Foundation always aspires
 to make people happy.

00:00:21.110 --> 00:00:25.500
I trust his beautiful tones
 will reach everyone.

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:29.250
A parting gift from my heart.

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:31.180
It's really him.

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:34.760
By the way, Mr. Grumman,

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:38.550
what are you going to use
this giant trapdoor for?

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:44.520
The ultimate performance requires
 the ultimate contrivance.

00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:47.850
Such a sweet sound.

00:00:48.190 --> 00:00:50.780
The end will begin here.

00:00:50.780 --> 00:00:55.780
They shall strum together
to awaken a new soul.

00:00:56.740 --> 00:01:00.980
Smash the vermilion and offer
up a requiem for a king.

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:35.000
<b>My Soul Calls My Name</b>

00:02:36.970 --> 00:02:38.350
Sorry.

00:02:38.350 --> 00:02:42.010
Akira's the only one who 
ended up joining the cause.

00:02:43.230 --> 00:02:45.140
I appreciate the help.

00:02:45.590 --> 00:02:48.270
You really know what
 the Foundation's goals are?

00:02:48.530 --> 00:02:52.430
Yeah, thanks to Kurokami-san
 and Kakihara-san.

00:02:52.820 --> 00:02:54.950
I can't believe Kakihara's dead, too.

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:59.650
I always thought he was horrible for
 attacking Chihiro-san so aggressively.

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:02.910
It's not fair that he ended
 up being a good guy.

00:03:03.670 --> 00:03:05.440
Our fight's not over.

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:09.290
They've left it up to us

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:14.160
to stop Chaos' plans and 
survive, no matter what.

00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:20.160
I'm surprised a member of the Guardian
 State wants to work with us.

00:03:21.110 --> 00:03:25.550
After what happened to Kurokami
Marie-san, I thought they'd had enough.

00:03:26.460 --> 00:03:28.760
This is no time to be saying that.

00:03:28.760 --> 00:03:31.890
Marie acted of her own volition.

00:03:31.890 --> 00:03:33.740
So do we.

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:36.400
It has nothing to do with the Guardian State.

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:39.960
Right now we need all the people we can get.

00:03:40.830 --> 00:03:42.050
I'm sure you do.

00:03:45.960 --> 00:03:49.370
The six installed machines are
projecting barriers around each other.

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:51.370
It's impossible to destroy them.

00:03:52.100 --> 00:03:56.770
When this Big Dipper is completed, 
the Second Great Collapse will occur.

00:03:57.520 --> 00:04:00.760
Your chances of survival
will be practically zero.

00:04:01.740 --> 00:04:04.810
We just have to stop them before 
they connect the last one.

00:04:05.870 --> 00:04:08.460
According to the info
 Kakihara-san left me,

00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:13.070
the last one will be at the recently
completed Infinity Theater.

00:04:14.680 --> 00:04:17.220
It was built by the AVAL Science Foundation.

00:04:17.220 --> 00:04:18.830
It must be there.

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:24.630
Kakihara-san finally did
 something useful in the very end.

00:04:25.120 --> 00:04:26.830
What's so funny?

00:04:26.830 --> 00:04:30.660
Oh, I thought you'd be happy.

00:04:31.230 --> 00:04:35.450
The thorn in your side who kept
 digging through your past is gone.

00:04:35.450 --> 00:04:36.420
Don't.

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:39.920
Kakihara-san told me to live.

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:42.490
Like Inuki-san.

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:46.050
I will fulfill their wish.

00:04:47.380 --> 00:04:48.940
How magnificent.

00:04:48.940 --> 00:04:52.680
I'm sure you can swing your
 blade without hesitation

00:04:53.270 --> 00:04:57.020
even if Shiraki Yuri is among your enemies.

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:03.640
What an unpleasant woman.

00:05:03.640 --> 00:05:04.840
Chihiro-san.

00:05:05.130 --> 00:05:07.270
I won't give up.

00:05:07.270 --> 00:05:10.440
I'll change fate with my own hands.

00:05:13.110 --> 00:05:17.120
The time has come to cause
 the Second Great Collapse.

00:05:17.390 --> 00:05:21.910
Though we've adopted an infallible
 plan centered around Kark,

00:05:21.910 --> 00:05:23.130
we can't let our guard down.

00:05:24.020 --> 00:05:25.260
The final battle, huh?

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:27.500
What will we be doing with Yuri?

00:05:27.500 --> 00:05:29.970
She's useless.

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:32.640
We've got someone else who isn't doing anything.

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:35.070
Saving their strength?

00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:39.690
What if they turn out to be even
 more useless than Yuri?

00:05:40.020 --> 00:05:42.390
Chiyu is my masterpiece.

00:05:43.250 --> 00:05:44.780
Don't compare them to Yuri.

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:46.760
Wow, scary.

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:49.780
Even your own daughter, huh?

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:51.000
What?

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:56.050
Is that how you abandoned your 
experimental subjects, too?

00:05:56.650 --> 00:05:57.790
My subjects?

00:05:59.160 --> 00:06:02.290
I don't remember my failures.

00:06:04.070 --> 00:06:08.590
If you don't want to be scrapped,
 you'd best show me how useful you are.

00:06:09.180 --> 00:06:10.500
Of course.

00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:12.140
This time I'll kill Kamina Chihiro.

00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:14.770
You'll be defending the other six locations.

00:06:14.770 --> 00:06:16.350
That's absurd!

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:20.650
If they're trying to destroy the last one,
 Kamina Chihiro will surely be there!

00:06:20.970 --> 00:06:23.800
Why are you doing this to me again?

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:25.660
I won't accept this!

00:06:26.200 --> 00:06:27.860
You don't get it.

00:06:28.320 --> 00:06:30.340
That's why.

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:37.870
One of us might ignore the artificial
 keystone to get his revenge.

00:06:38.280 --> 00:06:40.750
My decisions are final.

00:06:43.460 --> 00:06:45.400
Wait, Jun-san!

00:06:50.630 --> 00:06:53.180
That may have been my only chance.

00:06:54.540 --> 00:06:57.290
I should've killed you.

00:06:57.670 --> 00:07:00.640
Then I could've killed Kamina Chihiro.

00:07:02.180 --> 00:07:05.130
It's all because I was weak.

00:07:06.420 --> 00:07:07.380
Jun-san!

00:07:07.380 --> 00:07:08.560
Don't follow me.

00:07:12.930 --> 00:07:13.990
This is your fault!

00:07:14.460 --> 00:07:16.600
You've been talking to Kamina Chihiro, right?

00:07:16.600 --> 00:07:19.620
Lure him out so Jun-san can kill him, then!

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:21.120
I-I can't.

00:07:21.530 --> 00:07:23.130
Don't you feel bad for Jun-san?

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:25.430
He's not happy with the situation!

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:40.200
Kid.

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:44.000
Pretty bold of you to come here alone.

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:49.230
What's his deal?

00:07:52.040 --> 00:07:53.240
What's going on?

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:57.620
<b>Special Performance</b>

00:07:53.470 --> 00:07:57.620
On this day, they're transporting 
the artificial keystone.

00:07:58.000 --> 00:07:58.910
Or perhaps...

00:07:59.430 --> 00:08:02.040
They're causing the Second Great Collapse.

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:03.260
That's not good.

00:08:03.760 --> 00:08:07.630
But he went out of his way to tell us.

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:09.850
It must be a trap.

00:08:10.740 --> 00:08:12.810
Maybe they're issuing a challenge.

00:08:13.270 --> 00:08:15.550
"Stop us if you can."

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:17.710
They underestimate us.

00:08:17.710 --> 00:08:19.450
Let's get them, Chihiro-san.

00:08:19.940 --> 00:08:21.520
It's not that simple.

00:08:21.520 --> 00:08:22.910
Why not?

00:08:22.910 --> 00:08:24.220
It's a concert.

00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:27.020
There will be a lot of 
people in the audience.

00:08:27.290 --> 00:08:28.770
You mean, they're...

00:08:29.350 --> 00:08:31.620
They're all hostages.

00:08:31.620 --> 00:08:35.470
If we charge in there, they won't hesitate
 to turn all of them into monsters.

00:08:35.470 --> 00:08:37.060
How cruel.

00:08:37.060 --> 00:08:39.160
If the Second Great Collapse occurs,

00:08:39.460 --> 00:08:43.040
Tokyo will be turned into
 a hell swirling with evil spirits.

00:08:43.840 --> 00:08:45.670
We can't avoid making some sacrifices.

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:48.390
How can you say that so casually?

00:08:48.390 --> 00:08:49.530
Let's go.

00:08:50.040 --> 00:08:51.300
You serious?

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:53.340
But, the hostages...

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:55.500
They use some kind of sound...

00:08:55.920 --> 00:08:58.760
Some kind of resonance
 to transform people.

00:08:59.320 --> 00:09:04.170
With a full house, they'll most
 likely use Kark's piano music.

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:07.660
If we take him out before he can play...

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:11.070
I see. Great idea, Chihi.

00:09:11.070 --> 00:09:12.420
That would work.

00:09:21.010 --> 00:09:22.900
There's no other way.

00:09:22.900 --> 00:09:26.420
One mistake, and many will die.

00:09:28.460 --> 00:09:31.020
What can I do?

00:09:39.160 --> 00:09:40.990
Is this the answer?

00:09:40.990 --> 00:09:43.400
Who will die next?

00:09:43.400 --> 00:09:45.720
You can even appear in people's dreams?

00:09:47.300 --> 00:09:48.430
Dreams?

00:09:48.430 --> 00:09:50.530
You still don't understand.

00:09:50.530 --> 00:09:51.860
What do you mean?

00:09:53.800 --> 00:09:56.300
You thought you could change fate,

00:09:56.300 --> 00:09:59.350
but Kurokami Marie and
 Kakihara Isshin have vanished.

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:02.600
Expectations are the cause of all suffering.

00:10:02.600 --> 00:10:04.440
I'm not giving up.

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:06.640
Will killing Kark solve your problem?

00:10:07.510 --> 00:10:10.910
For the first time, you have a pure
desire the death of an individual.

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:13.320
That is murderous intent.

00:10:15.110 --> 00:10:18.750
And you used to find staining your hands
 with blood more repugnant than anything.

00:10:20.340 --> 00:10:22.130
I won't ask for forgiveness.

00:10:22.130 --> 00:10:25.870
If I'm going to stain my hands with
blood, I'll do it of my own volition.

00:10:26.620 --> 00:10:28.940
You're different this time.

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:36.460
I'm not afraid anymore.

00:10:39.070 --> 00:10:40.530
I can do it.

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:01.180
What are you doing here?

00:11:01.530 --> 00:11:05.090
It's not like you to rot away out here.

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:07.160
Go back to your post.

00:11:07.160 --> 00:11:09.310
They'll kill you if you ignore your orders.

00:11:09.640 --> 00:11:12.200
Kamina Chihiro is coming tonight.

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:15.120
I told them.

00:11:15.120 --> 00:11:16.220
You idiot.

00:11:16.220 --> 00:11:20.100
But at this rate, you won't
 be yourself anymore!

00:11:21.970 --> 00:11:22.950
Leave.

00:11:23.520 --> 00:11:26.100
I believe in you.

00:11:32.730 --> 00:11:34.210
It's starting soon.

00:11:34.620 --> 00:11:35.890
Everything look good?

00:11:36.480 --> 00:11:38.350
Everyone's inside, right?

00:11:38.350 --> 00:11:40.200
Let's go inside and listen.

00:11:40.200 --> 00:11:43.140
You idiot. Jun-san's not here.

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:44.480
We need to—

00:11:45.530 --> 00:11:46.520
What's that?

00:11:47.820 --> 00:11:49.520
Who are these guys?

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:50.680
They're flying!

00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:52.610
Uninvited guests.

00:11:52.610 --> 00:11:53.770
Kark Kaburagi?

00:11:55.380 --> 00:11:56.650
Fools.

00:12:02.110 --> 00:12:04.680
Wh-What is this?

00:12:06.070 --> 00:12:07.580
Go, Densuke!

00:12:15.970 --> 00:12:17.910
Hold it right there!

00:12:32.790 --> 00:12:34.210
Densuke!

00:12:34.210 --> 00:12:35.020
Tsubaki-chan!

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:38.940
Kotecchan?

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:54.950
Why, you...

00:12:55.530 --> 00:12:56.540
Haru!

00:12:57.650 --> 00:12:58.460
Akira?

00:12:58.910 --> 00:13:00.250
What are you...

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:02.210
Haru, stop this.

00:13:06.370 --> 00:13:10.180
I'll kill you for Jun-san!

00:13:10.180 --> 00:13:11.430
Stop, Haru!

00:13:14.120 --> 00:13:16.160
Apasionado.

00:13:36.180 --> 00:13:37.600
What?

00:13:37.600 --> 00:13:39.360
That's not Kamina Chihiro.

00:13:42.960 --> 00:13:44.710
Kark!

00:13:46.540 --> 00:13:48.560
A single surprise attack.

00:13:49.120 --> 00:13:53.180
It's the only way to kill Kark before
any of the audience members die.

00:13:53.490 --> 00:13:54.520
I'll handle it.

00:13:55.320 --> 00:13:56.360
Elsbernd.

00:14:05.720 --> 00:14:06.740
Kamina.

00:14:10.890 --> 00:14:12.400
You're mine.

00:14:12.400 --> 00:14:14.250
I won't let anyone else kill you.

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:17.000
Why now?

00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:19.220
Aoi Jun.

00:14:19.710 --> 00:14:21.960
You're an uninvited guest as well.

00:14:24.170 --> 00:14:26.590
But I shall allow it for now.

00:14:32.480 --> 00:14:33.580
Bastard!

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:36.520
I don't have time to fight you!

00:14:37.030 --> 00:14:39.020
I'm going to kill you!

00:14:39.020 --> 00:14:40.520
Only me!

00:14:41.600 --> 00:14:44.130
Die! Die! Die!

00:14:44.130 --> 00:14:45.240
Jun-san!

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:47.110
Did Kark...

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:49.750
The plan failed.

00:14:50.280 --> 00:14:53.030
The concert is at its climax.

00:14:53.370 --> 00:14:56.800
The sound calls to you from
 the bottom of a deep abyss.

00:14:56.800 --> 00:14:59.680
Sing, play, and exalt.

00:15:00.200 --> 00:15:02.040
Death has arrived.

00:15:05.060 --> 00:15:06.980
This isn't good. This is...

00:15:06.980 --> 00:15:07.960
Chihiro-san!

00:15:08.600 --> 00:15:10.680
Don't! Don't do it!

00:15:10.970 --> 00:15:14.180
Death has arrived. Death has arrived.

00:15:14.180 --> 00:15:16.140
Stop!

00:15:16.140 --> 00:15:18.140
Death has arrived!

00:15:21.460 --> 00:15:22.460
No...

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:24.810
Chihiro!

00:15:25.140 --> 00:15:26.930
That's the face.

00:15:26.930 --> 00:15:30.280
That's the face twisted with
 despair that I wanted to see.

00:15:33.040 --> 00:15:34.830
I won't give up.

00:15:34.830 --> 00:15:37.040
I promised Inuki-san.

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:40.290
As long as you don't give up,
 your wishes will come true.

00:15:40.560 --> 00:15:43.170
I'm going to save them.

00:15:43.870 --> 00:15:46.670
Show me the future you'll create.

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:47.900
I can, too!

00:15:47.900 --> 00:15:49.360
I can do it!

00:15:51.890 --> 00:15:53.550
Don't be ridiculous!

00:15:55.610 --> 00:15:57.410
Wh-What?

00:16:01.230 --> 00:16:02.390
Beautiful.

00:16:02.700 --> 00:16:04.000
Chihiro-san?

00:16:04.000 --> 00:16:06.650
Could he be the Lord of Vermilion?

00:16:09.190 --> 00:16:10.180
Tsubaki-chan!

00:16:12.340 --> 00:16:14.390
Let's let Chihiro handle this!

00:16:14.390 --> 00:16:17.240
We can't let that thing get outside!

00:16:20.980 --> 00:16:23.390
Damn it!

00:16:27.260 --> 00:16:29.590
Inuki-san trusted me to
carry out his dying wish!

00:16:31.990 --> 00:16:33.880
So I'll never give up!

00:16:34.390 --> 00:16:36.360
Y-You...

00:16:37.050 --> 00:16:38.850
You won't beat me!

00:16:39.920 --> 00:16:43.100
<i>It's no use. I can't win.</i>

00:16:44.450 --> 00:16:49.110
<i>I couldn't even stop you.
Of course I don't stand a chance.</i>

00:16:49.740 --> 00:16:52.320
<i>Is that why you chose him?</i>

00:16:55.040 --> 00:16:56.280
Fool.

00:16:56.690 --> 00:16:59.610
The source of the blood armaments'
 power is in their very name.

00:16:59.610 --> 00:17:02.040
Use too much, and you'll die of blood loss.

00:17:02.770 --> 00:17:05.920
<i>Is this how it ends?</i>

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:13.000
You're mine!

00:17:17.110 --> 00:17:19.100
Bravo.

00:17:19.100 --> 00:17:22.810
You successfully drew out the
 qualities of the Lord of Vermilion.

00:17:23.170 --> 00:17:27.860
But I'm not so generous that
 I'd so easily let you take his head.

00:17:30.780 --> 00:17:32.310
Sipario.

00:17:36.530 --> 00:17:39.120
Aoi Jun...

00:17:40.380 --> 00:17:43.330
The more wretchedly painted,

00:17:44.840 --> 00:17:47.350
the more beautiful the death.

00:17:48.340 --> 00:17:50.710
You killed Jun-san!

00:17:51.290 --> 00:17:53.590
I shall paint you, too.

00:17:56.760 --> 00:17:57.790
Akira...

00:17:59.610 --> 00:18:00.650
Haru...

00:18:01.510 --> 00:18:03.850
Why are you...

00:18:03.850 --> 00:18:07.420
It is truly beautiful to see
someone sacrifice themselves

00:18:07.420 --> 00:18:09.730
to save the one they love.

00:18:09.730 --> 00:18:10.980
However...

00:18:12.780 --> 00:18:15.970
It is even more beautiful
 when that turns to despair.

00:18:17.010 --> 00:18:17.990
No...

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:25.250
Kark...

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:31.080
Kamina Chihiro.

00:18:31.490 --> 00:18:35.280
The man who may have
 become the Lord of Vermilion.

00:18:35.280 --> 00:18:39.620
Regrettably, you heard my requiem.

00:18:39.620 --> 00:18:46.220
Now die. Your soul has been
 purified to black by my melody.

00:18:46.980 --> 00:18:48.480
Death has arrived.

00:18:50.700 --> 00:18:56.300
How can you toy with human
 lives, Kark Kaburagi?

00:18:57.330 --> 00:19:00.280
You won't get away with this.

00:19:02.960 --> 00:19:04.050
Chihiro-san?

00:19:04.840 --> 00:19:07.290
No, that's not Chihiro.

00:19:11.060 --> 00:19:12.490
The Lord of Vermilion.

00:19:15.080 --> 00:19:17.800
Come, Kamina Chihiro.

00:19:19.260 --> 00:19:20.720
Ahura Mazda.

00:19:25.410 --> 00:19:27.310
I-Incredible.

00:19:30.850 --> 00:19:34.480
I hesitated to stain my hands with blood.

00:19:37.970 --> 00:19:40.150
But not anymore.

00:19:40.530 --> 00:19:46.660
Haven't you forgotten to whom
 Azura Mazda's cry belongs?

00:19:47.820 --> 00:19:50.620
That's right. It's my fans.

00:19:50.620 --> 00:19:54.670
Can you kill thousands of lives?

00:19:55.410 --> 00:19:57.590
They aren't turning back now.

00:19:57.590 --> 00:20:02.180
Are you sure? It may be possible.

00:20:02.880 --> 00:20:05.930
And if it is, you can't kill me.

00:20:08.440 --> 00:20:09.580
Chihiro-san!

00:20:09.580 --> 00:20:10.770
Chihiro!

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:14.150
People are truly weak.

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:18.040
They cling to the faintest
 hope and fall into despair.

00:20:19.200 --> 00:20:21.680
Their only comfort is death.

00:20:22.400 --> 00:20:23.730
I can kill you.

00:20:24.480 --> 00:20:27.700
If staining my hands with blood is the
 path to becoming the Lord of Vermilion,

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:29.120
so be it.

00:20:30.390 --> 00:20:32.290
I don't care if I won't be forgiven.

00:20:32.290 --> 00:20:34.000
I'll bear that burden!

00:20:43.050 --> 00:20:45.310
You're stronger than I expected.

00:20:45.310 --> 00:20:47.810
You truly are supreme.

00:20:52.800 --> 00:20:55.290
The greatest achievement was mine.

00:20:55.290 --> 00:20:58.260
Did you see that, Dux-sama?

00:20:58.720 --> 00:21:00.140
Truly, I am...

00:21:02.330 --> 00:21:03.400
This is the end.

00:21:03.770 --> 00:21:05.160
Kark!

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:07.690
Where are you?

00:21:08.140 --> 00:21:11.010
I'd like to see the world you create,

00:21:11.010 --> 00:21:14.620
but granting you death is the greater joy.

00:21:15.330 --> 00:21:18.230
You won't want to miss the encore.

00:21:22.880 --> 00:21:25.900
We can't cause another Great Collapse anymore.

00:21:26.370 --> 00:21:27.640
What should we do?

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:30.440
Help me, Chiyu.

00:21:31.660 --> 00:21:33.990
Yes, Father.

00:21:33.990 --> 00:21:35.160
Thank you.

00:21:36.170 --> 00:21:39.090
Thank you, Mitsuki.
